{"id":"6d42a84e97b1092e","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-veblen-function.md","title":"Veblen Function","display":"df-veblen-function — Veblen Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-veblen-function","aliases":["72-df-veblen-function"],"display":"df-veblen-function — Veblen Function","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.1; print210–214; PDF222–226; explicit double transfinite recursion","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-veblen-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-veblen-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-veblen-function — Veblen Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.1; print210–214; PDF222–226; explicit double transfinite recursion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> 为序数；Veblen 层级是以下按序数指标递归给出的可定义类族。固定所有最小值均在序数的良序中取。</li>\n<li>对每个固定 α，先按 β 作枚举递归；在计算 α 层时，所有 ξ&lt;α 层已经给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_0(\\beta):=\\omega^\\beta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_0(\\beta):=\\omega^\\beta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta):=\\min\\{\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:\\forall\\xi&lt;\\alpha\\ (\\varphi_\\xi(\\gamma)=\\gamma)\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\beta\\ (\\varphi_\\alpha(\\delta)&lt;\\gamma)\\}\\quad(0&lt;\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta):=\\min\\{\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:\\forall\\xi&lt;\\alpha\\ (\\varphi_\\xi(\\gamma)=\\gamma)\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\beta\\ (\\varphi_\\alpha(\\delta)&lt;\\gamma)\\}\\quad(0&lt;\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 IV 章 §1.1 的 Veblen 函数（对应闭无界类的严格递增连续枚举）。集合多个正规函数的公共不动点类仍闭且无界：从任意界开始，逐阶段同时超过全部 ξ&lt;α 的值，再取 ω 次上确界即可；闭性来自每个函数的连续性。因此每次最小值存在，且由两层递归唯一。没有使用“满足以下条件的层级”等自然语言代替构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_0(\\beta):=\\omega^\\beta.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta):=\\min\\{\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:\\forall\\xi<\\alpha\\ (\\varphi_\\xi(\\gamma)=\\gamma)\\land\\forall\\delta<\\beta\\ (\\varphi_\\alpha(\\delta)<\\gamma)\\}\\quad(0<\\alpha).","display":true}],"bytes":1509,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-veblen-function|df-veblen-function — Veblen Function]]"},{"id":"d09902009c3b686f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_\\alpha(\\beta)$ 见 [[72-df-veblen-function]]，$n\\in\\omega$；$\\gamma$ 和 $\\Gamma_0$ 由以下显示式引入。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-veblen-function|df-veblen-function — Veblen Function]]"},{"id":"486d4a31c44186af","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma$ 为序数，$\\alpha<\\beta$；$\\varphi$ 为 [[72-df-veblen-function]] 的层级。"}],"outgoing":[]}